# JavaScript SDK

Install the JavaScript client with `npm install @larkspur/client`. It requires Node.js 18 or newer and ships TypeScript type definitions.

```js
import { Client } from "@larkspur/client";
const client = new Client({ url: "http://localhost:7420", token: process.env.LARKSPUR_TOKEN });
await client.enqueue("resize-image", { id: 7 }, { priority: 8 });
```

The client retries network errors automatically and supports idempotency keys.
